			"Message": "chore(Maintain): Update Rust submodule and standardize whitespace in build tools\n\nExecute a submodule update for the Documentation/Rust repository to include newly generated API documentation for the Build system, covering PlistEdit and environment constants.\n\nIn the main Maintain crate, replace literal tab characters in `Source/Build/JsonEdit.rs` and `Source/Build/PlistEdit.rs` with escaped tab bytes (`\\t`) to ensure consistent code formatting. Additionally, correct the HTML entity escaping for the ampersand in the `README.md` funding acknowledgement section.\n\nThese changes ensure the build tooling adheres to Rust coding standards and that documentation renders correctly without raw control characters in source code or markdown.",
